        "text_GPiGR7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Every necklace, keychain, earring, and more is handcrafted from that original material, with gold leaf added to each piece to bring out the richness of the source. Hudson's on Woodward Avenue was a cornerstone of Detroit life for generations, and these pieces are a way to hold onto that connection in something you can wear every day. If you're shopping for a Detroit gift for someone with roots in the city, this collection hits differently.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell has been handcrafting meaningful jewelry in Detroit since 2013. </strong>Every piece is made by our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce development program. So your purchase supports both a one-of-a-kind piece of Detroit history and women building better futures right here in the city. Learn more <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"our story\">about our story</a> and read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"reviews\">our customer reviews.</a></p>"
          }
